+//                           E
+// -----+--------------------+--------------------+-----
+//      |                    |                    |
+//   1.1...10 2^-3fff    1.1...11 2^-3fff    1.0...00 2^-3ffe
+//   0.1...11 2^-3ffe                                   (biased, 1)
